Angeldust Helper does not collect, store, or share personal user data.
It only processes Discord interactions in order to respond to commands.

When you use the Bot, Discord may provide basic information such as:
user ID
server ID
channel ID
command input
This data is only used temporarily to make the Bot work.

The Bot does not store any user data or message history.
All responses are generated in real time and are not saved.

No user data is sold, shared, or sent to third parties.

The Bot uses Discord’s API to function. No additional services are used to track or profile users.

If you have questions about this policy, you can contact the bot developer via Discord.
